title: "Cascading geohazards of the Çaldıran–Van fault–lake system (Eastern Anatolia): figure-reproduction code"
abstract: "Reproducible geospatial figure-generation code for a study of crustal deformation and earthquake-triggered cascading geohazards across the Çaldıran, Erçiş and Van fault systems of Eastern Anatolia, and their long-term expression in the late Quaternary archive of Lake Van."
type: software
